      "object": "Dissatisfaction based on body fat was more strongly related to DE than the drive for muscularity. Surfers dissatisfied with their body fat levels were more vulnerable to DE than those with a high drive for muscularity. The surfers who were more concerned with their amount of body fat appeared to be more vulnerable to the onset of anorexia and/or bulimia nervosa."
